bronchoalveolar lavage specimens, but all corresponding NPAs were negative. Seven of 15 (47%) children with PCP died 
while hospitalized compared with 24 of 136 (18%) without PCP [relative risk, 1.21 (range, 0.99 to 1.47), P= 
